# RFC-0071 Phase 1 advisory lint allowlist.
# Format (one entry per line):
#   path:line        — line-anchored (fragile across edits)
#   path::symbol     — symbol-anchored (preferred, stable)
#
# Seeded 2026-05-12 from docs/rfc/RFC-0071-inventory.csv.
# Phase 5 (RFC-0071 §4) will narrow this to (a)-class sites only
# after codemod (WS-3) closes (b) and (c) class sites in main lib.
#
# Every entry must match a site the lint currently detects. exhaustive-guard.sh
# reports entries that match nothing and fails on them under BLOCKING=1, so a
# line anchor that drifts out of its file is caught rather than left behind.
# Prefer path::symbol: line anchors die whenever a file is split.

